# Press Marksman (R8): long, thin, slow and precise. Long steel barrel with a muzzle brake, a scope with a cyan
# lens on top (the only accent), bolt handle and a skeleton stock. 5 cm voxels.
name marksman
grid 5
size 24 3 7
slot body Ink
slot glow NeonCyanEdge
slot wood InkBrown
slot steel Steel
slot lens NeonCyanEdge
box 0 0 1 2 2 4 wood
box 2 0 1 5 2 2 wood
box 2 0 3 5 2 4 wood
box 4 0 1 11 2 4 body
box 6 0 0 8 2 2 body
box 9 0 0 10 2 1 body
beam 11 1 3 22 1 3 1 steel
box 21 0 2 23 2 4 steel
box 11 0 2 14 2 4 wood
beam 5 1 5 11 1 5 1 body
box 5 0 4 6 2 5 steel
box 9 0 4 10 2 5 steel
box 11 0 5 12 2 6 lens
box 4 0 5 5 2 6 lens
box 7 2 3 8 3 4 steel
# Readability stripe (h-content hand-off: dark guns vanished on the dark suit from behind): a glowing top line.
paint box 4 0 3 11 2 4 glow
pivot 7 1 2
